==German==

===Etymology===
{{suffix|de|Zone|t1=zone|-i}}. ''Zone'' is short for {{m|de|sowjetische}} {{m|de|Besatzungszone}} (“Soviet occupation zone”), the common West German name for the [[w:German Democratic Republic|GDR]] before 1970 (and colloquially after it).

===Noun===
{{de-noun|m|Zonis|Zonis}}
# (historical, colloquial) a citizen of the former [[DDR]] (German Democratic Republic)

